\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Light of the world, Thy beams I bless;
\par On Thee, bright Sun of Righteosness,
\par My faith has fixed its eye;
\par Guided by Thee, through all I go,
\par Nor fear the ruin spread below,
\par For Thou art always nigh.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Not all the powers of hell can fright
\par A soul that walks with Christ in light;
\par He walks, and cannot fall:
\par Clearly he sees, and wins his way,
\par Shinig unto the perfect day,
\par And more than conquers all.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. I rest in Thine almighty power;
\par The name of Jesus is a tower,
\par That hides my life above;
\par Thou canst, Thou wilt my Helper be:
\par My confidence is all in Thee,
\par The faithful God of love.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Wherefore, in never-ceasing prayer,
\par My soul to Thy continual care
\par I faithfully commend;
\par Assured that Thou through life shall save,
\par And show Thyself beyond the grave
\par My everlasting Friend.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

